
Description:

A WebDAV, CalDAV or CardDAV MOVE of a collection onto an existing collection
now replaces it (204 No Content), or fails with 412 Precondition Failed when
Overwrite is F (RFC 4918, Section 9.9.3).  Previously the server answered
with a malformed status line ("HTTP/1.1 Mailbox already exists").  The MOVE
also fails with 423 Locked while a member of the collection it would
overwrite holds a lock whose token was not submitted.

The other errors of the destination check no longer become a malformed status
line either: a MOVE of a collection to a place where the user may not create
one now fails with 403 Forbidden, with DAV:need-privileges when permission is
what is missing.


